@HelpDeskPro.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5239

GET {{HelpDeskPro.API_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

@accessToken = replace-with-a-valid-jwt

### Get role-scoped dashboard summary
GET {{HelpDeskPro.API_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Check API liveness (anonymous)
GET {{HelpDeskPro.API_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Check API and SQL Server readiness (anonymous)
GET {{HelpDeskPro.API_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json
